My question, and a solution are give below.

QUESTION

 Is there an better way, i.e. using apply or matrix computations to do the
 following?
 for(j in 1:nsamp)
   {for(i in 1:3) 
     {if((gooddata[j, i] != 0)) {g[j, i] <- gooddata[j,i]}
     else g[j, i] <- NA}}

ANSWER

 g <- gooddata
 g[g == 0] <- NA

