the test in S-PLUS and then pass the test result to your C function as
an extra argument.

in S-PLUS
 tr <- is.null(z)
 .C("my_routine", x, y, z, as.integer(length(x)), as.integer(tr))

in C
void my_routine(double *x, double *y, double *z, long *n, long *tr)
 {
   ...
   ...
   if (tr ==1) 
     do_something();
   else
     do_something_else();
   ...
 }

