From joel at sparc6a.harvard.edu  Wed Apr 12 14:16:36 2000
From: joel at sparc6a.harvard.edu (Joel Schwartz)
Date: Wed, 12 Apr 2000 10:16:36 -0400
Subject: Re: [S] Question about GAM Model Selection using AIC
In-Reply-To: <38F33CF2.89815E39@ncsu.edu>
