From venables at acland.qld.cmis.csiro.au  Sun Apr 23 07:38:56 2000
From: venables at acland.qld.cmis.csiro.au (Bill Venables)
Date: Sun, 23 Apr 2000 17:38:56 +1000
Subject: Re: [S] Piecewise Linear Regression
In-Reply-To: <3.0.1.32.20000422163036.0072a270@sfsu.edu>
