the following references in Current Index to Statistics.  

78PrInStMa 25      29-  40 J
Threshold values as safe levels and the hockey stick regression method (STMA
V22 1748)
Yamamoto, E.;Takeshima, K.;Yanagimoto, T.

79EnvHlthP 32     193- 199 J
Estimation of safe doses: Critical review of the hockey stick regression
method
Yanagimoto, Takemi;Yamamoto, Eiji

With due respect to all Canadians of Japanese ancestory, I don't think these
researchers reside here in the Great White North.  However, it is a safe bet
that someone else coined the name before these papers.  So, Nick and Ransom,
